1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,125
{\an8}SKERRY POINT - EPISODE THREE

2
00:00:04,525 --> 00:00:05,725
Sixteen weeks.

3
00:00:06,125 --> 00:00:07,688
Petar, how are the gulls?

4
00:00:08,088 --> 00:00:09,900
Nine, and one of them is new.

5
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:12,300
- New?
- It is a different nine.

6
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:14,325
<i>Ivo looks betrayed.</i>

7
00:00:14,725 --> 00:00:16,225
That is worse than four.

8
00:00:16,625 --> 00:00:18,625
The Light held again last night.

9
00:00:19,025 --> 00:00:21,213
The Light is warm and has opinions.

10
00:00:21,612 --> 00:00:24,612
He has been here three weeks and he says it too.

11
00:00:25,012 --> 00:00:27,075
It is in the log. I read the log.

12
00:00:27,475 --> 00:00:28,675
You read the log?

13
00:00:29,075 --> 00:00:30,275
Somebody has to.

14
00:00:30,675 --> 00:00:33,675
<i>The tender's horn, two long notes, early.</i>

15
00:00:34,075 --> 00:00:36,012
The first is not for nine days.

16
00:00:36,412 --> 00:00:37,975
It is a very early first.

17
00:00:38,375 --> 00:00:41,625
It is the same tender. It is always the same tender.

18
00:00:42,025 --> 00:00:43,587
Marta, there is a letter.

19
00:00:43,987 --> 00:00:45,550
There is always a letter.

20
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:47,825
<i>This time she opens it.</i>

21
00:00:48,225 --> 00:00:49,425
Ninety-seven.

22
00:00:49,825 --> 00:00:51,025
Ninety-eight.

23
00:00:51,425 --> 00:00:53,612
- Petar?
- I have not counted them.

24
00:00:54,012 --> 00:00:55,212
Count them.

25
00:00:55,612 --> 00:00:59,550
<i>He goes. The lamp turns. The room goes white, then dark.</i>

26
00:00:59,950 --> 00:01:01,700
Ninety-seven, and a landing!

27
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:03,300
I like him.

28
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:05,325
{\an8}END OF EPISODE THREE

